{"unit_id":"xuedipiaofei__dsh-session-title-stamp#card-zh","repo":"xuedipiaofei/dsh-session-title-stamp","commit":"24e533682f06f6ed251ada3c9c4b0e485bd984f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Session title stamp：为 DSH Web 会话生成日期、分类和主题标题。插件注册标题 provider，支持回合后自动刷新、手动重生成与复制、模板和分类设置，并在悬浮卡展示耗时、估算费用及 token 数。适合整理多项目会话；需要可用的会话模型路由，且无需单独配置 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:535-556","lib/index.js:594-618","client.js:662-708"]}
